3. **Advanced Analytics Platform**
   * Built real-time analytics dashboard with 30-second polling intervals
   * Implemented comprehensive metrics including customer retention and satisfaction
   * Created performance monitoring with staff efficiency and operational metrics
   * Added business intelligence visualization with charts and trend analysis

