## Success Metrics and KPIs

* **Performance Metrics**: Sub-100ms MQTT latency, <30s dashboard refresh, 99.9% uptime
* **User Engagement**: Daily active users, session duration, feature adoption rates
* **Business Metrics**: Customer retention rate, revenue per facility, support ticket volume
* **Technical Metrics**: Database query performance, API response times, error rates
* **Security Metrics**: Zero security incidents, compliance audit scores, access control effectiveness

## Risk Mitigation Strategies

* **Technical Risks**: Comprehensive backup strategies, redundant systems, automated monitoring
* **Security Risks**: Regular security audits, penetration testing, incident response procedures
* **Performance Risks**: Load testing, capacity planning, performance monitoring alerts
* **Business Risks**: Customer feedback loops, competitive analysis, market validation

This implementation plan reflects the current state of the Hetri PAW platform as a comprehensive, enterprise-grade facility management system with advanced real-time capabilities, desktop deployment, and scalable multi-facility architecture ready for production deployment and ongoing enhancement. 